sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HW as TIM2 Hardware
    participant ISR as TIM2_IRQHandler
    participant Kernel as FreeRTOS Queue / EventList
    participant SCB as NVIC SCB->ICSR
    participant PendSV as PendSV_Handler
    participant Task as Task_Consumer (Prio 3)

    Note over Task: Blocked on xQueueReceive(..., portMAX_DELAY)
    HW->>ISR: TIM2 Update Event (UIF set, Vector 44)
    activate ISR
    ISR->>HW: Acknowledge flag (TIM2->SR = ~TIM_SR_UIF)
    ISR->>Kernel: xQueueSendFromISR(queue, &seq, &xHigherPriorityTaskWoken)
    activate Kernel
    Kernel->>Kernel: memcpy item to queue storage
    Kernel->>Kernel: xTaskRemoveFromEventList(xTasksWaitingToReceive)
    Note over Kernel: unblocked_prio (3) > current_task_prio (0/Idle) -> xHigherPriorityTaskWoken = pdTRUE
    Kernel-->>ISR: return pdPASS, xHigherPriorityTaskWoken = pdTRUE
    deactivate Kernel
    ISR->>SCB: portYIELD_FROM_ISR() -> writes PENDSVSET (bit 28)
    ISR-->>HW: Exception Exit (bx lr)
    deactivate ISR
    Note over HW, PendSV: Cortex-M tail-chains directly to lowest-urgency PendSV
    activate PendSV
    PendSV->>PendSV: Context switch (save outgoing, restore Task_Consumer PSP)
    PendSV-->>Task: Exception Return (0xFFFFFFFD)
    deactivate PendSV
    activate Task
    Note over Task: Unblocks from xQueueReceive(), processes sequence_number
    deactivate Task
